  'engines.whisper.desc': 'Whisper runs with Vulkan, Metal or the CPU, plus an optional CUDA pack for recent NVIDIA cards (GitHub builds for Windows and Linux). Three model sizes let you balance transcription quality against memory use and speed.',
  'engines.parakeet.name': 'Parakeet',
